msgstr "USSD代碼傳送埠"

msgid "Sending USSD code in plain text"
msgstr "以純文字形式傳送USSD代碼"

msgid "Receive message without PDU decoding"
msgstr "接收訊息而不進行PDU解碼"

msgid ""
"Send the USSD code in plain text. Command is not being coded to the PDU."
msgstr "以純文字形式傳送USSD代碼。指令不會被解碼為PDU。"

msgid "Receive and display the message without decoding it as a PDU."
msgstr "接收到的訊息將不進行PDU解碼而顯示。"

msgid "Explanation of number and prefix"
msgstr "關於號碼和字首的說明"

msgid ""
"In the tab for sending SMSes, show an explanation of the prefix and the "
"correct phone number."
msgstr "在允許傳送簡訊的選項卡中顯示關於字首和正確電話號碼的說明。"

msgid ""
"The phone number should be preceded by the country prefix (for Poland it is "
"48, without '+'). If the number is 5, 4 or 3 characters, it is treated as "
"'short' and should not be preceded by a country prefix."
msgstr ""
"電話號碼前應加上國家字首（對於波蘭是48，不帶'+'號）。如果號碼是5、4或3個字"
"元，則視為「短號碼」，不應加國家字首。"

msgid ""
"The phone number should be preceded by the country prefix (for Poland it is "
"48, without +). If the number is 5, 4 or 3 characters, it is treated as.. "
"short and should not be preceded by a country prefix."
msgstr ""
"電話號碼前應加上國家字首（對於波蘭是48，不帶+號）。如果號碼是5、4或3個字元，"
"則視為短號碼，不應加國家字首。"

msgid "Add prefix to phone number"
msgstr "為電話號碼新增字首"

msgid "Automatically add prefix to the phone number field."
msgstr "自動在電話號碼欄位中新增字首。"

