"User interface for sending AT commands using sms-tool. More information "
"about the sms-tool on the %seko.one.pl forum%s."
msgstr ""
"用於使用sms-tool傳送AT指令的使用者介面。有關sms-tool程式的更多資訊，請訪"
"問%seko.one.pl論壇%s。"

msgid ""
"User interface for sending USSD codes using sms-tool. More information about "
"the sms-tool on the %seko.one.pl forum%s."
msgstr ""
"用於使用sms-tool傳送USSD代碼的使用者介面。有關sms-tool程式的更多資訊，請訪"
"問%seko.one.pl論壇%s。"

