msgstr "請選擇埠"

msgid "User contacts"
msgstr "使用者聯絡人"

msgid "Enable group messaging"
msgstr "啟用群組訊息"

msgid ""
"This option allows you to send one message to all contacts in the user's "
"contact list."
msgstr "此選項允許向使用者聯絡人清單中的所有聯絡人傳送一條訊息。"

msgid "Message sending delay"
msgstr "訊息傳送延遲"

msgid "[Bot] Message sent to number:"
msgstr "[機器人] 訊息已傳送至號碼："

msgid "User USSD codes"
msgstr "使用者USSD代碼"

msgid ""
"Each line must have the following format: 'Contact name;phone number'. For "
"user convenience, the file is saved to the location <code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/"
"phonebook.user</code>."
msgstr ""
"每行必須具有以下格式：'聯絡人姓名;電話號碼'。為方便使用者，聯絡人儲存在檔案"
"<code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/phonebook.user</code>中。"

msgid ""
"Each line must have the following format: 'At command description;AT "
"command'. For user convenience, the file is saved to the location <code>/etc/"
"modem/atcmmds.user</code>."
msgstr ""
"每行必須具有以下格式：'AT指令描述;AT指令'。為方便使用者，指令儲存在檔案"
"<code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/atcmmds.user</code>中。"

msgid ""
"Each line must have the following format: 'Code description;code'. For user "
"convenience, the file is saved to the location <code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/"
"ussdcodes.user</code>."
msgstr ""
"每行必須具有以下格式：'代碼描述;代碼'。為方便使用者，代碼儲存在檔案<code>/"
"etc/modem/ussdcodes.user</code>中。"

